WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.403
On the twenty-sixth of December

2
00:00:02.403 --> 00:00:04.717
2004, a great earthquake struck

3
00:00:04.717 --> 00:00:05.893
off Sumatra.

4
00:00:05.893 --> 00:00:06.765
Hours later,

5
00:00:06.765 --> 00:00:08.762
waves reached India's coasts with

6
00:00:08.762 --> 00:00:09.998
no warning.

7
00:00:10.337 --> 00:00:13.218
It was of magnitude 9.1,

8
00:00:13.218 --> 00:00:15.017
one of the largest ever

9
00:00:15.017 --> 00:00:16.210
recorded.

10
00:00:16.562 --> 00:00:18.015
A tsunami is a series

11
00:00:18.015 --> 00:00:19.469
of waves set off when

12
00:00:19.469 --> 00:00:21.678
the sea floor suddenly moves.

13
00:00:21.678 --> 00:00:23.189
In deep water it's low

14
00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:23.966
and fast.

15
00:00:23.966 --> 00:00:25.582
Near the coast it piles

16
00:00:25.582 --> 00:00:26.378
up.

17
00:00:27.045 --> 00:00:27.854
In 2007,

18
00:00:27.854 --> 00:00:29.789
India set up its tsunami

19
00:00:29.789 --> 00:00:32.321
early warning centre at INCOIS,

20
00:00:32.321 --> 00:00:33.646
in Hyderabad.

21
00:00:33.646 --> 00:00:35.210
It now serves the whole

22
00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:37.043
Indian Ocean region.

23
00:00:37.378 --> 00:00:38.649
Your turn.

24
00:00:38.649 --> 00:00:40.927
Who runs India's tsunami warning

25
00:00:40.927 --> 00:00:41.982
centre?
